# Firmware for local wasm demos is not committed — except the public demos below, whose code is
# ours (hello_world from ESP-IDF for both the S3 and the C3, the Touch-LCD-4B panel built with
# placeholder secrets, and the Atech Pocket Synth) and the manifests that describe them.
# The mask ROM ELF (Apache-2.0, espressif/esp-rom-elfs) is fetched by the Pages workflow.
*
!.gitignore
!README.md
!demos.json
!hello.json
!c3-hello.json
!c6-hello.json
!c6-energy-scan.json
!c6-contiki.json
!c6-contiki-net.json
!panel.json
!panel-sid.json
!atech.json
!atech-sid.json
!public/
!public/*
